abstract: >-
  Exploratory research program and multimodal software originated by Jair Ivan Rojas Ruiz
  (ORCID: 0009-0003-1109-4583) for measuring acoustic, visual, and linguistic features of
  audiovisual works with time-aligned provenance, and for formulating an exploratory state-space
  model of how such features might relate to audience belief states. The signal measurements are
  computed directly from media files; the stance coding and the state-space model are hypotheses
  that have not yet been validated against independent annotators or measured audience responses.
